    "The original tool dialog and QuickConnect pass an exact approved public target to paired preparation/report/start drafts. Continuous startup is a separate terminal copy action, never browser execution. Commands and technical details fold after proposal; explicit full-fingerprint consent remains.",
    "Resolved three concrete integration gaps: existing pairing diagnostics lacked exact source aliases; identity-path mode could omit a bound expected Worker; a fresh existing selection needed a safe new-pairing action for another machine."
